<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.handle.rotates ~ the Handle's presentation key, rotated

`lares handle rotate` seats a fresh key on the persona's Handle by a handle-KEL rotation the persona's owner-binding authorizes, so a lost presentation key recovers through the persona.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`rotate` params=`~ rotate the Handle's key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ persona

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`persona` params=`takes/index ~ the persona whose Handle acts; absent, the store door's default`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/handle-head ~ the store door signs on the WHO board under the Handle's key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ rotated

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`rotated` params=`exit/0 ~ the card's glamour, nym and act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares handle rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares handle rotate]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

